## Layout

Clean Architecture Django layout:

- `manage.py` — Django CLI entrypoint
- `src/domain/` — pure domain concepts
- `src/application/` — use cases
- `src/infrastructure/` — persistence and external clients
- `src/presentation/` — DRF HTTP API
- `src/config/` — settings, URLs, ASGI/WSGI
